-|----------|---------|--------|-------|
-| New weekly report | ✅ Yes | 50 KES | First time |
-| New monthly report | ✅ Yes | 200 KES | First time |
-| Existing weekly report | ❌ No | Free | Already paid |
-| Existing monthly report | ❌ No | Free | Already paid |
-| Failed payment | ❌ No | - | Retry possible |
