-                         CHARGING RULES
-================================================================================
-
-                    New Report?          Amount    Notes
-Weekly (7 days)     YES                  50 KES    First time
-Weekly (30 days)    YES                  50 KES    First time
-Monthly (30 days)   YES                  200 KES   First time
-Monthly (90 days)   YES                  200 KES   First time
-
-Any existing        NO                   FREE      No duplicate
-report              (free access)                  charge
-
-Failed payment      NO                   -         Can retry
