-│   └── transactionCount
-├── shops/{shopId}/sales/{DDMMYYYY}/transactions
-│   ├── productName
-│   └── totalPrice
-├── shops/{shopId}/expenses/{DDMMYYYY}/transactions
-│   ├── category
