-
-## Error Handling Strategy
-
-### Three-Layer Validation
-
-**Layer 1: Command Parser**
-- Checks basic syntax
-- Returns null if unparseable
-
-**Layer 2: Command Validator**
-- Type-specific rules
-- Returns error code
-
-**Layer 3: Transaction Service**
-- Firestore operations
-- Network/auth errors
-
-### Error Flow
-
